        "username": "Noble_Draconian",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/noble_draconian/{size}/8899145_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-05-15T21:13:21.761Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/scipioafrikanos\">@ScipioAfrikanos</a>! Thanks for the response.</p>\n<p>How are developers expected to test multi-server systems that involve calls to <code>TeleportService</code>? We cannot do this in studio, and now we cannot do it with multiple clients. If you don’t have extra computers laying around, there’s <em><strong>physically no way</strong></em> to test these systems! Developers essentially just have to “guess and hope it doesn’t break”.</p>",
